1
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:11,933
Go.

2
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,500
The Jiuli's ancient corpse control art

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,300
not decaying after death,

4
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,200
controlled by people.

5
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,633
and can be restrained by Chenzhou talisman.

6
00:00:36,166 --> 00:00:36,966
I brought the talisman paper.

7
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,500
One stroke to the sky.

8
00:00:44,766 --> 00:00:45,700
Second, ground control.

9
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,066
The third stroke lifts the talisman.

10
00:00:47,566 --> 00:00:48,700
Fourth, the soul follows.

11
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:49,533
Rise!

12
00:00:51,966 --> 00:00:52,800
You go first.

13
00:01:16,933 --> 00:01:17,566
Quick!

14
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,100
I can't hold on.

15
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,433
What's that?

16
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,366
Xiaoqian,

17
00:02:05,733 --> 00:02:06,166
are you okay?

18
00:02:07,866 --> 00:02:08,900
Don't forget what I told you.

19
00:02:09,566 --> 00:02:10,500
the two artifacts

20
00:02:10,733 --> 00:02:11,566
one of them is the Thunder Bell.

21
00:02:11,866 --> 00:02:12,866
which is enshrined in the ancestral hall of Juli Village.

22
00:02:13,233 --> 00:02:13,633
You go quickly

23
00:02:13,966 --> 00:02:15,333
and get it before them.

24
00:02:15,666 --> 00:02:16,466
I'll go find Long Fei.

25
00:02:16,633 --> 00:02:17,300
Try to hold him off.

26
00:02:27,866 --> 00:02:28,433
Go away.

27
00:02:32,566 --> 00:02:33,366
Oh no.

28
00:02:34,233 --> 00:02:36,000
The corpse is changing.

29
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,400
Don't kill me.

30
00:03:05,933 --> 00:03:06,900
Don't be afraid,

31
00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:07,900
I'm here.

32
00:03:14,633 --> 00:03:15,600
If you don't wake up,

33
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,333
I'll feed you to the Shanshan Zombie.

34
00:03:20,333 --> 00:03:21,333
I just had a seizure.

35
00:03:21,533 --> 00:03:22,400
Did I hurt you?

36
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:24,700
You can't even touch me with three moves.

37
00:03:26,766 --> 00:03:27,133
Glutinous rice?

38
00:03:28,533 --> 00:03:29,233
black dog blood?

39
00:03:29,766 --> 00:03:31,100
These are the things to deal with corpse poison.

40
00:03:31,266 --> 00:03:32,433
Sister, I'm not infected with corpse poison.

41
00:03:33,266 --> 00:03:34,733
You're not bitten, why are you crazy?

42
00:03:34,966 --> 00:03:36,466
Yelling and screaming scared me to death

43
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,066
Look what this is.

44
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:39,666
I found it from a zombie.

45
00:03:40,133 --> 00:03:40,966
In 1985,

46
00:03:42,133 --> 00:03:42,800
it was a scientific expedition team!

47
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,066
I heard that

48
00:03:44,533 --> 00:03:45,000
ten years ago,

49
00:03:45,433 --> 00:03:46,700
the Red Witch sacrificed Dragon Moon

50
00:03:46,933 --> 00:03:49,000
led an expedition to Tian Gong Tower to search for treasure,

51
00:03:49,233 --> 00:03:49,900
but never returned.

52
00:03:50,566 --> 00:03:51,600
Long Yue is my mother.

53
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,033
She went to Tian Gong Tower not for the treasure,

54
00:03:53,366 --> 00:03:54,066
but to find an antidote for me.

55
00:03:54,666 --> 00:03:55,300
So,

56
00:03:55,733 --> 00:03:57,400
you went to Tian Gong Tower to find her.

57
00:03:58,666 --> 00:04:00,666
So why did you go to the Tian Gong Building?

58
00:04:02,066 --> 00:04:02,866
Just like you.

59
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,833
I'm also looking for my missing relatives.

60
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,633
I hope we can all get what we want.

61
00:04:14,833 --> 00:04:15,933
What is this bell?

62
00:04:16,333 --> 00:04:17,466
It's a Jiuli ancient artifact,

63
00:04:17,733 --> 00:04:18,366
Thunderclap Bell.

64
00:04:18,933 --> 00:04:20,466
It's one of the keys to open the Tian Gong Building.

65
00:04:20,933 --> 00:04:21,800
This direction,

66
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,933
is the ancestral hall of Juli Village.

67
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,666
When I was a child, I was bitten by a Gu worm,

68
00:04:29,066 --> 00:04:30,233
and my hands were infected with ghost energy.

69
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,966
It was the witch Cao who helped me suppress the Gu poison.

70
00:04:33,433 --> 00:04:34,500
After my mother passed away,

71
00:04:35,233 --> 00:04:37,466
it was Cao Guipo and A Yao who took me in.

72
00:04:37,466 --> 00:04:38,533
Except my mother,

73
00:04:38,866 --> 00:04:40,166
they are the closest people to me.

74
00:04:40,666 --> 00:04:41,266
Now,

75
00:04:41,266 --> 00:04:42,000
I'm still here.

76
00:04:42,533 --> 00:04:43,933
Others are afraid of your ghost hand,

77
00:04:44,666 --> 00:04:45,666
but I'm not afraid.

78
00:04:46,333 --> 00:04:47,266
Whether you are human or ghost,

79
00:04:47,266 --> 00:04:48,266
I will be with you.

80
00:05:03,933 --> 00:05:04,733
Granny Cao,

81
00:05:05,366 --> 00:05:07,500
The ancestral temple of Jiuli Village belongs to me.

82
00:05:07,666 --> 00:05:08,633
Get out of here.

83
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:09,833
If you still resist,

84
00:05:10,366 --> 00:05:11,633
I'll beat you and her together.

85
00:05:17,566 --> 00:05:18,366
Fire spirit bug.

86
00:05:25,766 --> 00:05:26,500
Dead girl,

87
00:05:27,033 --> 00:05:28,366
cripple her hand.

88
00:05:34,466 --> 00:05:36,166
Ah Yao, Ah Yao.

89
00:05:45,333 --> 00:05:46,166
Who dares to touch her?
